    <title>Cross-Modal Attention for Infrared &amp; Visible Image Fusion
  under Weak Supervision</title>
    <summary>  We propose a cross-modal attention module that aligns infrared and visible
features without paired annotations. Experiments on three benchmarks show
consistent gains, and we discuss the conditions under which the alignment
degrades.
</summary>
